  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "永續發展的法治與實踐",
    "sub_ename": "THE RULE AND PRACTICE OF THE SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "了解聯合國與國際公約對於全球氣候變遷與永續發展重點與脈絡，並掌握我國相關規範落實程度及實務作為。期待同學透過本課程，提出與反思是否有更好的應對模式，或者尚有待國家、社會及個人努力的領域。",
    "describe_eh": "Students can understand the focus and background of the United Nations and international conventions on global climate change and the sustainable development, as well as the degree of implementation and practical actions of relevant domestic laws and regulations. We hope that students can use this course to propose and reflect on whether there is a better handling model or areas in which efforts are still required by the country, society and individuals.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
